Metadata-Version: 2.1
Name: keepa-reserved-fixture
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Synthetic provider distribution that claims the reserved built-in id "web".
Author: EvidenceWiki contributors
License: MIT
Requires-Python: >=3.10

Exists to prove that built-in provider ids can never be shadowed by a registration, even
when the rest of the declaration is well formed.
